  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm creating an avatar for Spookality, and I've noticed that the button entries in Action Menus appear with a blank icon, are labeled as \"Button Text\", and seem to be non-functional. Toggles and submenus are fine, as well as the buttons in the GoGoLoco submenu added via VRCFury, so I'm not quite 100% sure is a bug.\n\nI'll leave a couple of buttons on the avatar for now, the ID:\n\navtr_0ae41d3f-ae4a-437d-b429-4b1dbb217d20\n\nToggle \"a\" turns on emission, button \"c\" is supposed to change its colour.\n\n(if it was changed externally, \"b\" would change it back to red)",
